# dn42 Root Authority CA
#
# Trust anchor for HTTPS geofeeds on .dn42 hostnames. Every live dn42
# geofeed chains to this root through burble.dn42's ACME intermediate;
# none of them validate against the public trust store, because dn42
# runs its own certificate authority.
#
# This root is used IN ADDITION to the system trust store, and only for
# hosts under .dn42. Clearnet feeds keep validating normally.
#
#   subject     C=XD, O=dn42, OU=dn42 Certificate Authority,
#               CN=dn42 Root Authority CA
#   self-signed yes
#   valid       2016-01-16 .. 2030-12-31
#   sha256      7C:16:2C:DA:B7:CB:97:E9:8C:60:C0:04:EB:36:D7:4E:7B:EC:0D:7F:EB:20:AB:59:BC:9E:99:65:8B:62:D3:E7
#
# Verified on 2026-08-22 against burble.dn42, feeds.lpnet0.dn42,
# franta.dn42, geofeed.lutoma.dn42, geofeed.raumzeitlabor.dn42 and
# xiaoxi654.dn42: all six validate with verification enabled.
#
